@startuml
title DEPLOY-K8S 改造后 Kubernetes 部署图
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
actor "普通用户/创作者" as User
actor "审核员/管理员" as Admin
actor "直播主播\nOBS/推流工具" as Streamer
cloud "公网/Ingress" as Ingress
node "Kubernetes Cluster" as Cluster {
  node "Namespace: danmakustream" as NS {
    node "frontend Deployment\nNginx Pods" as Frontend
    node "api-gateway Deployment\nGateway Pods" as Gateway
    node "user-service Deployment" as UserSvc
    node "content-service Deployment" as ContentSvc
    node "engagement-service Deployment" as EngagementSvc
    node "live-service Deployment" as LiveSvc
    node "notification-service Deployment" as NotifySvc
    node "worker Deployment" as Worker
    node "srs Deployment" as SRS {
      component "RTMP" as RTMP
      component "HTTP/HLS" as HLS
    }
    database "MySQL StatefulSet" as MySQL
    database "Redis" as Redis
    folder "PersistentVolume\nmedia-data" as Media
  }
}
User --> Ingress
Admin --> Ingress
Streamer --> Ingress : RTMP
Ingress --> Frontend : HTTPS
Ingress --> Gateway : /api, /ws
Frontend --> Gateway : API/WebSocket
Gateway --> UserSvc : auth/profile
Gateway --> ContentSvc : video/media
Gateway --> EngagementSvc : danmaku/comment/like
Gateway --> LiveSvc : live/schedule
Gateway --> NotifySvc : notification/message
Worker --> MySQL : scheduled jobs
ContentSvc --> MySQL
UserSvc --> MySQL
EngagementSvc --> MySQL
LiveSvc --> MySQL
NotifySvc --> MySQL
EngagementSvc --> Redis : hub/cache/rate limit
LiveSvc --> SRS : stream metadata
Streamer --> RTMP : publish
Frontend --> HLS : playback
ContentSvc --> Media : upload/transcode
Worker --> Media : FFmpeg jobs
note right of Cluster
改造后按领域拆分部署；服务通过内部 API 访问
用户、内容、互动、直播和通知边界，数据层集中持久化
end note
@enduml
